Package: janeattestationengine
Maintainer: Ian Oliver <ian.oliver@oulu.fi>
Priority: optional
Section: admin
Depends: adduser
Recommends: mosquitto, python3, python3-argon2, python3-pymongo
Description: Jane Attestation Engine
 Remote attestation server: holds known-good values for elements and attests
 and verifies them through trust agents such as tarzan.
 .
 Requires MongoDB, which is not in Debian: install it from MongoDB's own
 repository (see docs/quickstart.md), and an MQTT broker such as Mosquitto.
